OL,3,AStaggered age of consent to be
OL,4,Adiscussed after Brand case, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FA discussion over a staggered age of
OL,8,Fconsent is to take place, the work and
OL,9,Fpensions secretary has said, as the
OL,10,Fgovernment faces calls to change the
OL,11,Flaw following the case against Russell
OL,12,FBrand.
OL,14,FSpeaking to the BBC's Sunday with Laura
OL,15,FKuenssberg, Pat McFadden said that
OL,16,F"appalling" stories of "abuse of power
OL,17,Fby powerful men" have emerged this
OL,18,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
