OL,3,AMan and woman die in police pursuit
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been killed after their
OL,7,Fcar was hit by a vehicle fleeing from
OL,8,Fpolice in Leeds.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said it happened
OL,11,Fat 00:44 GMT, when a blue BMW 123D
OL,12,Ffailed to stop for officers in Gelderd
OL,13,FRoad and then crashed into a white
OL,14,FVolkswagen Scirocco.
OL,16,FThe driver of the Volkswagen, a
OL,17,F22-year-old man, died at the scene. His
OL,18,Fpassenger, a woman, 23, died later in
OL,19,Fhospital. Both were from York.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
