OL,3,ATrident submarine returns home after
OL,4,Arecord-breaking undersea patrol
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Navy submarine carrying Trident
OL,7,Fnuclear missiles has returned to its
OL,8,FScottish base after a record-breaking
OL,9,F217 days spent submerged on patrol.
OL,11,FThe 140-strong crew of HMS Vengeance
OL,12,Fhave spent the tour in almost total
OL,13,Fisolation beneath the surface after
OL,14,Fsetting out from Faslane, near
OL,15,FHelensburgh, Argyll and Bute, on 12
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting was at
OL,19,FHM Naval Base Clyde to welcome them
OL,20,Fhome after the longest deployment at
OL,21,Fsea for a British vessel.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
