OL,3,AIran targets US military base in
OL,4,ABahrain with drone attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran launched a drone attack against a
OL,7,FUS military base in Bahrain on Sunday,
OL,8,Fits second attempt to target the
OL,9,Fcountry in three days.
OL,11,FThe country's Islamic Revolutionary
OL,12,FGuard Corps (IRGC) said it targeted the
OL,13,FUS air defence radar facility at
OL,14,Fal-Riffa air base in Bahrain using six
OL,15,Fdrones.
OL,17,FBahrain's military said its air defence
OL,18,Fsystems intercepted and destroyed the
OL,19,FIranian air attacks "before they could
OL,20,Fachieve their objectives".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
