OL,3,AThree men sentenced to death in Jordan
OL,4,Aover fatal church mass shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan's Armed Forces said in a
OL,7,Fstatement on Sunday that the men had
OL,8,Fbeen convicted of committing "terrorist
OL,9,Facts", as well as possessing weapons,
OL,10,F"promoting the ideas of a terrorist
OL,11,Forganisation" and "conspiracy to commit
OL,12,Fterrorist acts".
OL,14,FThe three men - two Jordanian brothers
OL,15,Fand their brother-in-law - fled the
OL,16,Fscene of the attack and were arrested
OL,17,Fthree days later. They have not been
OL,18,Fpublicly identified.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
